e harsh environment to stay alive. Resources are scarce, the weather is unforgiving, and the local wildlife, including dangerous polar bears, poses a constant threat.\n\nGather supplies, build shelters, and work together to find a way off the mountain. Do you have what it takes to survive the crash and make it back to safety?\n\nFeatures:\n\n➊Survival Mechanics: Manage your hunger, warmth, and water to stay alive.\n\n➊Resource Gathering: Scavenge the wreckage and the environment for vital supplies.\n\n➊Shelter Building: Construct shelters to protect yourself from the elements.\n\n➊Wildlife Encounters: Beware of polar bears and other wildlife as you explore.\n\n➊Teamwork: Collaborate with other players to increase your chances of survival.\n\nPrepare for an intense and thrilling survival adventure in \"Survive Flight 871\"!\n\nPlease share plane crash\n\n\n","path":"/game/16884010485-survive-flight-871","slug":"16884010485-survive-flight-871","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/193b67ff90001af503ce71b7e4f1dfd9bd692c2d1786bc82a41a0be7b20ba763.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b998c1c02810797888078276ea94b031/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":22,"visitor":73958459,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-07-30T16:07:24.652Z","creator":{"name":"Lillmannen_real","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":14056754882,"name":"Flex Your UGC Limiteds","desc":"View & flex your UGC limiteds and RAP on others! Snipe free limiteds with our purchase auto-prompts, hang out and wait for new limited drops, make deals, try on items, and more!\n\n🔔 Automatic Free Limited Sniping Prompts 🔔\n• Be in the game\n• Wait for a prompt when any free website limited drops\n• Click the Buy button\n• You just sniped a free UGC limited!\n\nFeatures\n🏷️ FREE UGC limited notifier\n🎯 Hyper Sniper! Enter item IDs to get instant auto-prompts to buy when they go on sale!\n💰 Limited Deals board automatically scans for deals on UGC limiteds 